WEBVTT

00:01.570 --> 00:02.890
Hey, Master.

00:02.890 --> 00:06.480
I haven't seen St. Weirdo in half 
a year. Do you know what's up?

00:06.480 --> 00:09.380
I haven't heard a peep from him.

00:09.380 --> 00:11.380
Last time I saw him was 
when he stopped by

00:11.380 --> 00:14.700
to stock up on a bunch 
of food and Substance X.

00:14.700 --> 00:16.910
Maybe he's off on an expedition.

00:17.250 --> 00:20.190
Now that you mention it, 
since St. Weirdo disappeared,

00:20.190 --> 00:22.840
clinic fees have really gone up.

00:24.150 --> 00:25.540
Could it be...?

00:26.000 --> 00:30.140
Has St. Weirdo been locked up by the Church?!

00:26.000 --> 00:31.050
<b>St. Weirdo</b>

00:36.550 --> 00:40.810
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

00:37.640 --> 00:40.810
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

02:04.470 --> 02:08.980
<b>Fiftieth Floor</b>

02:09.480 --> 02:12.120
<i>This is the last of my food.</i>

02:10.480 --> 02:14.230
#12 S-Rank Healer and Exorcist Luciel's Declaration

02:13.870 --> 02:17.540
<i>If the next one isn't 
the final boss, I'm done for.</i>

02:19.010 --> 02:21.560
<i>If I die here, I wonder...</i>

02:22.530 --> 02:26.560
Will I become undead or something, too?

02:27.250 --> 02:28.470
Spell tome.

02:29.430 --> 02:32.440
Guess I'd better take a look through this guy.

02:30.210 --> 02:33.460
<b>Spell tome received after defeating the floor forty boss</b>

02:33.460 --> 02:35.880
"Sanctuary circle."

02:33.670 --> 02:34.440
<b>Sanctuary Circle</b>

02:34.440 --> 02:48.060
<b>Sanctuary Circle</b>

02:35.880 --> 02:38.450
"Purges magic of the dark affinity,

02:38.450 --> 02:42.010
and burns all demons and ghosts
 within the circle."

02:42.010 --> 02:45.970
"A spell of hope which 
protects all that is holy."

02:45.970 --> 02:48.060
That's so cool!

03:05.290 --> 03:06.640
Oh wow.

03:07.050 --> 03:09.490
You really do look like the final boss.

03:11.460 --> 03:12.980
You're a big one...

03:12.980 --> 03:16.670
Might as well call you King Wight, I guess.

03:16.670 --> 03:19.080
O holy touch of healing.

03:19.080 --> 03:21.220
O breath of the mother of this great land.

03:21.220 --> 03:24.190
O Lord, I offer up my magic.

03:24.190 --> 03:26.140
Bring relief as from the breath of an angel

03:26.140 --> 03:29.390
and heal the spirits 
residing within all things.

03:29.760 --> 03:31.060
Area high—

03:32.440 --> 03:33.900
That was close!

03:33.900 --> 03:36.610
Faces? That's so creepy!

03:39.990 --> 03:41.360
Purification!

03:44.000 --> 03:45.320
When did he...

03:46.140 --> 03:49.700
Black arts? Is that dark affinity magic?

03:49.700 --> 03:52.350
Then I'll go ahead and test this out!

03:52.350 --> 03:54.330
Sanctuary circle!

04:04.720 --> 04:08.450
It looks... effective...

04:08.450 --> 04:11.950
I'm running out of magic... Magic potion!

04:19.360 --> 04:21.740
If I keep doing this over and over,

04:21.740 --> 04:24.320
I'll eventually run out of potions,
and he'll get me.

04:24.320 --> 04:26.530
I've got to finish him off quickly!

04:27.070 --> 04:29.290
O holy touch of healing.

04:29.890 --> 04:31.790
O breath of the mother of this great land.

04:32.290 --> 04:34.420
<i>I don't know if this will work or not.</i>

04:34.890 --> 04:38.130
O Lord, I offer up my magic.

04:38.130 --> 04:41.340
Harness a shield of purification 
like the radiant wings of an angel

04:41.340 --> 04:45.800
and bring forth a sanctuary
to sear all that is evil and impure.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.010
Sanctuary circle!

04:48.010 --> 04:49.100
Go!

04:54.920 --> 04:56.080
Did that do it?

04:58.520 --> 04:59.480
Uh-oh!

05:15.800 --> 05:17.710
<i>His face at the end...</i>

05:18.020 --> 05:21.840
<i>What if all of the monsters 
and bosses I've beaten so far</i>

05:21.840 --> 05:25.000
<i>were also once people like this old guy?</i>

05:25.540 --> 05:27.590
<i>I get the feeling that's what this means.</i>

05:28.180 --> 05:30.910
<i>And was he trying to tell me something?</i>

05:36.220 --> 05:37.550
What's this?

05:38.660 --> 05:40.720
"Forbidden Holy Magic"?

05:40.720 --> 05:43.530
I'm gonna have to report this to the pope.

05:44.230 --> 05:46.310
I'll put these away for now.

05:50.900 --> 05:52.080
What's that?

05:56.670 --> 06:00.080
Something smells really good.

06:03.420 --> 06:05.420
<i>It's draining my magic!</i>

06:15.890 --> 06:18.190
It leads to another staircase.

06:18.190 --> 06:21.080
<i>Guess that means I keep going.</i>

06:26.690 --> 06:28.460
<i>Another level?</i>

06:35.160 --> 06:37.970
<i>A d-d-dragon?!</i>

06:37.970 --> 06:41.820
<i>This isn't funny! There's no way 
I could beat something like that!</i>

06:45.770 --> 06:50.080
<i>I-Is it undead? It isn't moving, though...</i>

06:50.390 --> 06:52.510
<i>They say that dragons are intelligent.</i>

06:52.510 --> 06:54.470
<i>It might even be able to speak.</i>

06:54.910 --> 06:58.930
<i>If it </i>is<i> undead, maybe I can use 
sanctuary circle to turn it back.</i>

06:58.930 --> 07:01.400
<i>If I can't, this is game over.</i>

07:01.400 --> 07:04.190
<i>But I don't have any other choice!</i>

07:04.190 --> 07:06.730
Sanctuary circle!

07:23.870 --> 07:26.460
D-Did I defeat it?

07:26.460 --> 07:28.800
It sure looks cool up close...

07:29.270 --> 07:32.510
There's no way I'd win 
in a real fight against thi—

07:34.220 --> 07:36.830
<i>I'm dead meat! I'm gonna get eaten!</i>

07:40.310 --> 07:44.180
You bested me with one attack. 
Quite impressive.

07:44.180 --> 07:46.270
I shall grant you a reward.

07:47.050 --> 07:48.560
Look at all that treasure!

07:48.560 --> 07:50.650
You may take it all with you.

07:50.650 --> 07:54.110
Er, are you sure this isn't a trap?

07:54.570 --> 07:59.790
Be at ease. There are no evil spirits 
left on this level, are there?

07:59.790 --> 08:03.460
Once you collect the remaining magic 
stones, the labyrinth will disappear.

08:04.130 --> 08:10.050
I will let you choose how to proceed. 
A special privilege for you alone.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.540
<i>He doesn't seem like a threat.</i>

08:12.540 --> 08:15.860
<i>Maybe he'll answer if I ask him something.</i>

08:16.280 --> 08:19.310
What exactly is the purpose 
of this labyrinth?

08:19.880 --> 08:25.790
We of the dragon race were sealed away
where miasma gathers.

08:26.700 --> 08:29.320
This labyrinth is one such place.

08:30.310 --> 08:35.110
If you were trapped here,
 shouldn't a hero have come to rescue you?

08:35.420 --> 08:37.780
No hero ever appeared.

08:38.610 --> 08:42.580
But that is not all that
has transpired here in this world...

08:46.210 --> 08:49.160
I can't believe that's what happened...

08:51.920 --> 08:53.630
What? What?!

08:54.120 --> 08:56.590
You stand before a great reward,

08:56.590 --> 08:59.890
yet you are not clutching at it
 or overwhelmed by greed.

08:59.890 --> 09:01.440
I like that.

09:01.440 --> 09:02.770
What?

09:02.770 --> 09:05.100
I shall grant you my protection.

09:05.100 --> 09:08.160
<i>Wait, what? That sounds scary!</i>

09:08.160 --> 09:09.640
What is your name?

09:10.100 --> 09:14.740
Luciel. But I don't know 
about this protection...

09:14.740 --> 09:19.090
Be at ease. I will merely 
make you harder to kill.

09:19.090 --> 09:20.950
Oh, in that case, I'll gladly take it!

09:20.950 --> 09:26.920
Luciel... From here on, monsters
will only grow more powerful.

09:27.420 --> 09:30.660
Save as many beings as you can.

09:31.100 --> 09:35.130
I pray that will include my brethren.

09:36.850 --> 09:41.890
My protection and my remains, 
Luciel, I confer upon you.

09:47.660 --> 09:50.070
I have upheld my oath.

09:55.630 --> 09:58.610
<i>Save as many beings as you can.</i>

09:59.930 --> 10:03.600
<i>I pray that will include my brethren.</i>

10:05.340 --> 10:08.610
I understand. I'll do everything in my power.

10:09.290 --> 10:14.050
<b>Title acquired: Blessed by the Healer God
Title acquired: Protected by the Holy Dragon
Title acquired: Dragonslayer</b>

10:10.330 --> 10:14.050
<b>Title acquired: Blessed by the Healer God
Title acquired: Protected by the Holy Dragon
Title acquired: Dragonslayer</b>

10:11.590 --> 10:14.050
<b>Title acquired: Blessed by the Healer God
Title acquired: Protected by the Holy Dragon
Title acquired: Dragonslayer</b>

10:15.190 --> 10:18.340
Great. All picked up.

10:25.530 --> 10:27.630
A staff and a necklace?

10:29.850 --> 10:32.370
Whoa! Could I be going home—

10:37.190 --> 10:41.370
<b>Title acquired: He Who Released the Seal</b>

10:43.080 --> 10:48.040
<b>As result of your oath to the holy dragon,
you can now sense where dragons are sealed away</b>

10:51.060 --> 10:53.080
I did it! I made it—

10:54.150 --> 10:55.500
back home.

10:55.500 --> 10:56.710
I just got back!

10:59.360 --> 11:02.170
Cattleya-san?! That was really mean!

11:02.170 --> 11:04.350
Did I do something to you?

11:04.670 --> 11:06.310
You're still alive!

11:06.310 --> 11:09.540
Yeah... I think I am...

11:10.890 --> 11:13.740
I'm so glad you're safe! Really!

11:13.740 --> 11:15.940
Th-Thank you.

11:15.940 --> 11:18.860
<i>Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow! Not so tight!</i>

11:18.860 --> 11:23.490
You were gone for half a year.
I thought something happened in the labyrinth.

11:25.200 --> 11:28.500
I just assumed you were escaped undead!

11:31.650 --> 11:35.010
You gave me quite a fright just now.

11:35.010 --> 11:37.670
I almost thought I was a goner there myself...

11:38.260 --> 11:40.560
But now isn't the time for this!

11:40.560 --> 11:42.230
You have to stop the adventurers!

11:42.230 --> 11:43.430
Excuse me?

11:44.700 --> 11:46.890
Free our St. Weirdo!

11:46.890 --> 11:49.430
<b><i>Free St. Weirdo!!</i></b>

11:47.350 --> 11:50.350
<b>Give him back!</b>

11:47.730 --> 11:50.350
Release the healer Luciel!

11:51.440 --> 11:52.390
Quick! This way!

11:52.390 --> 11:54.690
What is this all about?

11:56.860 --> 11:58.180
Master?!

11:58.620 --> 12:00.870
And even Gulgar-san and Galba-san?

12:00.870 --> 12:03.320
Hey! What about me?

12:03.960 --> 12:05.070
Hey, kid.

12:05.070 --> 12:08.030
E-Everyone... what's going on?

12:10.280 --> 12:13.140
Get a load of this guy! He's still kicking!

12:13.140 --> 12:14.450
What a relief!

12:14.450 --> 12:16.630
Where were you for the last half year?

12:17.040 --> 12:19.810
<i>Did they all think I was dead?</i>

12:20.150 --> 12:21.820
I gotcha!

12:23.430 --> 12:28.510
Hey, Whirlwind. I'll go and tell 
the folks outside that the kid's okay.

12:28.510 --> 12:32.480
Don't forget to stop by 
the Adventurers' Guild later, St. Weirdo!

12:32.480 --> 12:34.230
Yeah, he'll be there!

12:34.230 --> 12:35.260
I give! I give!

12:35.260 --> 12:38.630
Say, you're awful cheery all 
of a sudden, Whirlwind.

12:38.630 --> 12:41.690
Huh? Don't be ridiculous.

12:42.090 --> 12:45.460
So, what brings you all to the capital?

12:45.460 --> 12:48.140
Really? You don't know?

12:48.140 --> 12:51.710
Well, Luciel always has been kinda...

12:51.710 --> 12:54.570
You could call him special.

12:57.990 --> 12:59.880
They sure are rowdy out there.

12:59.880 --> 13:02.630
Is today a city festival or something?

13:04.210 --> 13:06.090
That's a good one, man!

13:04.380 --> 13:06.090
<b>What a weird kid...</b>

13:06.090 --> 13:09.300
So, what were you doing all this time?

13:09.300 --> 13:11.520
Well, I was...

13:11.520 --> 13:14.060
<b><i>GRRROWL</i></b>

13:14.650 --> 13:16.690
Thank you for the food!

13:17.830 --> 13:20.040
<i>At the Adventurers' Guild,</i>

13:20.040 --> 13:23.690
<i>Gulgar-san and the guildmaster put together 
some dishes that made me drool,</i>

13:23.690 --> 13:24.650
Gross!

13:23.690 --> 13:26.230
<i>and then made me chug Substance X.</i>

13:24.810 --> 13:25.440
That stinks!

13:25.440 --> 13:27.030
It reeks!

13:27.030 --> 13:30.830
<i>People who couldn't afford clinics
 heard the rumors</i>

13:30.830 --> 13:35.290
<i>and overwhelmed the guild,
so I reinstated "St. Weirdo's Free Day."</i>

13:36.810 --> 13:39.880
<i>Then I took advantage
of Master Brod being around.</i>

13:43.460 --> 13:45.130
I'm gonna go all out.

13:45.990 --> 13:48.430
Look at you, getting all cocky.

13:48.750 --> 13:50.350
Come at me whenever you're ready.

13:50.350 --> 13:51.600
Here I go!

13:54.420 --> 13:57.450
It looks like you're 
starting to get it together,

13:57.450 --> 14:00.940
but did you really feel like you'd
 gotten <i>that</i> much stronger?

14:00.940 --> 14:05.030
Get up. I'll smack that false 
confidence right out of you.

14:05.030 --> 14:06.360
Yes, sir!

14:10.030 --> 14:12.110
More, more!

14:14.610 --> 14:17.460
Th-That's him, the urban legend...

14:17.820 --> 14:19.220
The Whirlwind!

14:20.070 --> 14:22.440
More, more...

14:22.440 --> 14:23.880
The maso-zombie!

14:23.880 --> 14:26.340
He was never just a legend!

14:27.680 --> 14:30.270
He's the real thing!

14:30.270 --> 14:33.000
real thing... real thing...

14:33.730 --> 14:36.270
If you need anything else, 
I'll come a-running.

14:36.270 --> 14:38.880
We're so happy you survived, Luciel!

14:39.410 --> 14:43.110
You're the only one Brod-san 
can take his stress out on, Luciel!

14:43.110 --> 14:44.280
You don't say...

14:44.280 --> 14:47.020
Our masochist club meets 
later on. You should come!

14:47.610 --> 14:50.780
Heal us if we get hurt again, okay?

14:50.780 --> 14:55.870
Wow, he brought up that 
masochist club without any hesitation.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.410
Hey, Luciel.

14:58.140 --> 14:59.780
My idiot apprentice.

14:59.780 --> 15:00.870
<i>So mean!</i>

15:00.870 --> 15:04.340
Look at how many people 
were worried about you.

15:04.940 --> 15:10.090
But you're still so, so weak. 
You need to be aware of that.

15:10.090 --> 15:11.430
Yes, sir!

15:11.430 --> 15:13.130
Hold on, Brod.

15:13.130 --> 15:18.060
If you don't dial it back, Luciel 
might never come home to Merratoni!

15:19.930 --> 15:22.110
That isn't true at all.

15:22.110 --> 15:26.270
Of course I'll come home.
So please look me in the eye, Master.

15:26.270 --> 15:28.740
Next time, I'll train you too.

15:28.740 --> 15:33.840
I think my style of fighting might be more 
fitting for a coward like you, Luciel-kun.

15:33.840 --> 15:36.120
Don't you dare steal my apprentice.

15:36.120 --> 15:40.500
When you come back to Merratoni, 
bring one of your girlfriends with you.

15:40.810 --> 15:42.690
Girlfriends?

15:42.690 --> 15:44.080
Oh, that's right!

15:44.810 --> 15:49.050
Would you mind giving these letters 
to Nanaella-san and Monika-san for me?

15:49.050 --> 15:53.760
Oh? Has your master become
 your private courier?

15:53.760 --> 15:57.170
Either way, I think these will please them.

15:57.170 --> 16:01.350
They were ready to drop everything 
and rush off to the capital, after all.

16:01.350 --> 16:05.950
I'd be in trouble without them, 
so I somehow persuaded them to stay behind.

16:05.950 --> 16:07.630
Hmm?

16:07.630 --> 16:12.840
And who was it that dropped everything 
as instructor to come all the way here again?

16:13.720 --> 16:16.180
I'll get everything done once I get back.

16:16.180 --> 16:20.000
But seriously, Luciel, 
which one do you have your eye on?

16:22.370 --> 16:23.500
Which?

16:23.500 --> 16:28.580
Anyway, once you get married and have kids,
 I'll be the one training your—

16:29.250 --> 16:33.010
Brod, you sure aren't very sharp when 
it comes to people's feelings, are you?

16:33.010 --> 16:36.400
Hey! Back off!

16:33.530 --> 16:36.400
Right? I know.

16:34.470 --> 16:36.970
<b><i>Galba-san's strong!</i></b>

16:40.890 --> 16:43.140
Luciel, see you later.

16:43.140 --> 16:46.100
Yes, you will. Someday!

16:46.100 --> 16:47.460
We're expecting you!

16:48.090 --> 16:49.720
O-Okay!

16:57.320 --> 16:59.950
<i>Next, my report to the pope...</i>

17:00.870 --> 17:04.590
Dear Luciel, I'm very pleased 
that you returned alive.

17:04.590 --> 17:06.670
I apologize for any worry I caused.

17:06.670 --> 17:08.250
No, it's fine.

17:08.250 --> 17:12.210
Typically, we would have immediately 
sent someone to rescue you,

17:12.210 --> 17:14.870
but there were some voices of dissent.

17:15.180 --> 17:20.140
Ultimately, the Valkyrie Paladin 
Regiment did go in after you.

17:20.590 --> 17:24.090
<i>Lumina-san's team came for me?</i>

17:24.090 --> 17:27.090
But wraiths started to appear
after the thirty-first floor,

17:27.470 --> 17:29.970
leaving them no choice but to retreat.

17:29.970 --> 17:32.610
That is perfectly understandable.

17:32.610 --> 17:37.200
Now, why did you not return for half a year?

17:37.200 --> 17:40.060
Well, inside the labyrinth...

17:43.180 --> 17:44.970
Is that so?

17:44.970 --> 17:49.630
I certainly did not expect you to defeat 
the boss on the fiftieth level. Bravo.

17:49.630 --> 17:54.090
And ultimately you were able
to return without issue, I see.

17:56.360 --> 17:59.100
I beg your pardon,
but I have something to share now

17:59.100 --> 18:04.770
that I can only allow the pope, 
Cattleya-sama, and Lumina-sama to hear.

18:06.480 --> 18:08.630
You mean you refuse to tell us?

18:08.630 --> 18:10.060
You'd dare mock us?

18:10.060 --> 18:13.500
Even if it's adventurer business, 
who do you think you are?!

18:13.500 --> 18:15.110
It matters not.

18:15.750 --> 18:18.300
The rest of you may withdraw.

18:20.830 --> 18:25.830
<i>After she cleared the room, I told the pope 
about what happened on the fiftieth floor</i>

18:25.830 --> 18:30.060
<i>and spoke in detail about the forbidden 
holy magic tome I recovered.</i>

18:30.800 --> 18:33.100
Now this is the really important part...

18:34.220 --> 18:38.340
At the end of the fiftieth floor, 
I found an undead holy dragon!

18:41.310 --> 18:44.580
He said that he and his brethren 
had been cursed by a wicked deity

18:44.580 --> 18:47.340
and sealed away in labyrinths.

18:47.340 --> 18:49.350
He prayed for their freedom.

18:50.030 --> 18:51.430
Then he said...

18:51.430 --> 18:55.840
The next hero will not be born 
for another forty years.

18:56.470 --> 18:59.860
As the magical elements enveloping 
the world turn further toward darkness,

18:59.860 --> 19:02.620
monsters will become more powerful.

19:03.250 --> 19:05.050
Once that happens,

19:05.050 --> 19:09.790
it's likely not even heroes will be able
to defeat a newly born demon king.

19:09.790 --> 19:11.500
That's what he told me.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.970
A holy dragon? It cannot be...

19:18.670 --> 19:20.600
Cattleya. Lumina.

19:20.930 --> 19:24.890
I forbid you from speaking of what 
Luciel just said to anyone else.

19:24.890 --> 19:26.100
Your Holiness!

19:27.410 --> 19:33.350
But why is my level still stuck at 1?

19:34.250 --> 19:37.200
Why don't you take a look at your status?

19:37.200 --> 19:39.820
Okay. Status open.

19:39.820 --> 19:46.760
<b>Name: Luciel</b>

19:40.320 --> 19:46.760
<b>Job: Healer VIII, Holy Dragon Knight I</b>

19:40.820 --> 19:46.760
<b>Age: 18</b>

19:41.070 --> 19:46.760
<b>Level: 1</b>

19:42.440 --> 19:44.620
See? I'm still at level 1.

19:46.250 --> 19:48.510
You did add a job.

19:48.200 --> 19:49.350
<b>Magic Affinity: Holy</b>

19:48.510 --> 19:52.610
Also, does this look like
a level 1 status screen to you?

19:49.350 --> 19:51.790
<b>Skills
Assess Mastery I   Monster Luck I   Martial Arts VI
Meditation VII   Focus VIII   Strength Recovery VII
Butchery II   Detect Danger VI   Ambulation VI
Null Incantation III   No Incantation I   Magic Circle Incantation...
Detect Presence   Dual Spear-Sword Wielding III   Trap...
Accelerated Thinking II</b>

19:51.790 --> 19:53.100
<b>HP Growth Rate Up VIII   MP Growth Rate Up
STR Growth Rate Up VIII   VIT Growth Rate
AGI Growth Rate Up VIII   INT Growth Rate
RMG Growth Rate Up VIII   Physical Attribute Growth...</b>

19:52.610 --> 19:56.060
It <i>does</i> look like my numbers 
have gone up across the board...

19:53.100 --> 19:54.310
<b>Poison Resist VIII   Paralysis Resist VIII   Petrify Resist...
Curse Resist VIII   Enfeeble Resist VIII   Silence Resist...
