20:30.570 --> 20:34.780
In any event, Luciel, 
I appreciate your efforts.

20:34.780 --> 20:39.660
In one week, we shall hold a celebration 
in honor of your conquest of the labyrinth.

20:41.480 --> 20:45.610
The labyrinth that cast a long shadow 
over more than fifty years

20:45.610 --> 20:47.800
is now no more.

20:48.230 --> 20:52.770
This is thanks to the healer Luciel,
who cleared its deepest reaches.

20:53.090 --> 20:55.100
In commemoration of this achievement,

20:55.100 --> 20:59.070
I hereby promote Luciel to S-rank healer

20:59.070 --> 21:01.570
and grant him rank equivalent to a bishop.

21:02.210 --> 21:07.820
Furthermore, I bestow upon him the right 
to refuse orders from anyone other than myself

21:08.250 --> 21:10.790
as a reward for his great deed.

21:10.790 --> 21:16.660
I, Pope Fluna Alludelli 
de Shurule, declare it so.

21:17.440 --> 21:21.180
Now, Luciel, would you mind saying a word?

21:21.180 --> 21:25.660
<i>A sp-speech? I haven't given one 
since I was a salaryman!</i>

21:27.310 --> 21:28.180
<i>Here goes.</i>

21:36.020 --> 21:38.060
I am deeply honored by the introduction.

21:38.060 --> 21:41.890
On this day, I have been entrusted 
with the duties of an S-rank healer.

21:41.890 --> 21:43.440
My name is Luciel.

21:43.990 --> 21:45.930
I am still just a novice,

21:45.930 --> 21:49.020
and my only achievement so far 
is conquering the labyrinth.

21:49.020 --> 21:50.910
I realize that may not sound very exciting.

21:51.230 --> 21:54.760
However, please allow 
this uninteresting novice

21:54.760 --> 21:57.870
to tell you something even less exciting.

21:59.390 --> 22:01.840
It has been four years 
since I became a healer.

22:01.840 --> 22:05.300
But today, all of the Church's authority 
is on the verge of crumbling away.

22:06.840 --> 22:08.860
What did he just say?

22:08.860 --> 22:10.970
Is he in his right mind?

22:12.400 --> 22:14.560
<i>What could possibly be so funny?</i>

22:14.560 --> 22:16.680
<i>You're the ones who set this up!</i>

22:18.380 --> 22:20.650
It is now on the verge of crumbling away

22:21.100 --> 22:24.280
because of the unjust 
practices of arrogant healers.

22:24.590 --> 22:27.560
Healers are scorned by the people 
as money-hungry swindlers.

22:27.560 --> 22:29.460
They are deeply loathed.

22:29.460 --> 22:30.700
How did things come to this?

22:31.200 --> 22:33.920
Because the law has not 
evolved with the times.

22:33.920 --> 22:37.680
Because the fees for healing 
have not been regulated.

22:38.440 --> 22:44.180
Therefore, I declare that I will create 
new guidelines for medical treatment fees.

22:46.680 --> 22:51.110
This way, people will no longer be able to 
misuse the authority of the Church.

22:55.470 --> 22:56.580
Da...

22:58.950 --> 23:00.840
Daddy?

23:01.790 --> 23:03.480
Sheila?

23:03.820 --> 23:05.150
Daddy...

23:05.830 --> 23:07.930
Sheila! Your voice!

23:07.930 --> 23:09.370
Daddy!

23:09.890 --> 23:14.370
Let's spend our days working diligently 
to restore the authority of the Church!

23:15.470 --> 23:19.540
I shall do everything within 
my power to serve the Church,

23:20.180 --> 23:24.250
and as my life goal, I will spare no effort.

23:24.730 --> 23:26.390
I swear to it!

23:27.460 --> 23:30.220
Thank you for your time.

23:36.890 --> 23:42.440
<b>Name: Luciel</b>

23:36.890 --> 23:42.440
<b>Job: Healer VIII, Holy Dragon Knight</b>

23:38.470 --> 23:40.670
<i>I was once a salaryman,</i>

23:40.670 --> 23:44.060
<i>but to survive in another world, 
I've chosen a new path...</i>

23:46.530 --> 23:51.610
<i>And now I've been promoted to rank S!</i>
